      "questionHtml": "<p>Simplify:&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\dfrac{{5\\frac{3}{4} + 2\\frac{1}{2} \\times \\frac{7}{4} + 3\\frac{3}{4}}}{{22\\frac{1}{2}}} = \\ ?\\)</span></p>\n",
