      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong><span class=\"math-tex\">\\({\\rm{\\;}}\\frac{{5\\frac{3}{4}{\\rm{\\;}} + {\\rm{\\;}}2\\frac{1}{2}{\\rm{\\;}} \\times {\\rm{\\;}}\\frac{7}{4}{\\rm{\\;}} + {\\rm{\\;}}3\\frac{3}{{4{\\rm{\\;}}}}}}{{22\\frac{1}{2}}} = {\\rm{\\;}}?\\)</span></strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>Concept used:</strong></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/02/BODMAS.PNG\" /></p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>On solving the given fractions we get:</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(5\\frac{3}{4}\\)</span>&nbsp;=&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{{23}}{4}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 2<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{2}\\)</span> =&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{5}{2}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 3<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{3}{4}\\)</span>&nbsp;=&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{{15}}{4}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 22<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{2}\\)</span>&nbsp;=&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{{45}}{2}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>Putting the calculated value in the given equation we get:</p>\n\n<p>&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{{\\frac{{23}}{4}\\; + \\;\\frac{5}{{2\\;}} \\times {\\rm{\\;}}\\frac{7}{4}\\; + \\;\\frac{{15}}{4}}}{{\\frac{{45}}{2}}} \\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\Rightarrow {{{23 \\over 4} + {35 \\over 8} + {15 \\over 4}} \\over {45 \\over 2}}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\Rightarrow {(46 + 35 + 30) \\over 8} \\times {2 \\over 45}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\Rightarrow {111 \\over 8} \\times {2 \\over 45}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 37/60</p>\n<strong>&there4; Value of the given expression is&nbsp;37/60</strong>",
